error: the AGit push to HEAD:refs/for/main/fix-parser was refused

  refspec:  HEAD:refs/for/main/fix-parser
  git says: fatal: the receiving end does not support push options

what to do:
  AGit requires Git push options, which this server has disabled.
  1. ask the server administrator to enable Git push options
  2. fcli pr create --head <branch>  (create from a branch instead)
